    "detailed_description": "<strong>Night Blade</strong> is a Multiplayer, Fast-Paced Arena Fight game. Players(2-8) fight in various game modes to win in a cyberpunk arena. Every win will increase the rank of player. Higher ranks, higher rewards.<br><br><strong>Night Blade</strong> is a product of single developer. Take a place in cyberpunk world called Cryptex where riots turned into parties and fight clubs. Contains different types of characters, skills, abilities to fight. It provides a high voltage energetic game experience. Get ready for the pit.<br><br><strong>GAME MODES:</strong><br> - <strong>Football:</strong> Players hit the ball and try to put it on enemy base.<br> - <strong>Capture The Flag:</strong> Players steal the enemy flag and bring enemy flag to their base while defending their own flag.<br> - <strong>Crown: </strong> Players grab the crown and they keep it as much as they can without dying.<br> - <strong>Fight:</strong> Teams fight with each other and get points for every kill they get.<br> - <strong>Capture The Point:</strong> Players get control of a point and defend it.",
